#: ../../language/attributes/derive.md:1
msgid "Derive Attribute"
msgstr "Derive 属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/derive.md:3
msgid ""
"Use `#derive(...)` before a type definition to generate implementations "
"of supported traits. Each field must satisfy the requirements of the "
"derived trait."
msgstr "在类型定义前使用 `#derive(...)`，为支持的特征生成实现。每个字段都必须满足所派生特征的要求。"

#: ../../language/attributes/derive.md:7
msgid ""
"#derive(Debug)\n"
"struct DebugPoint {\n"
"  x : Int32\n"
"  y : Int32\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"pub extend DebugPoint with Debug::{to_repr}\n"
"\n"
"test \"derive debug struct\" {\n"
"  let point = DebugPoint::{ x: 1, y: 2 }\n"
"  debug_inspect(point, content=\"{ x: 1, y: 2 }\")\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/attributes/derive.md:13
msgid ""
"See [Deriving traits](/language/derive.md) for supported traits and their"
" options. `moon fmt` migrates the older trailing `derive(...)` syntax."
msgstr "支持的特征及其选项见[特征派生](/language/derive.md)。`moon fmt` 可以迁移旧的尾置 `derive(...)` 语法。"
